WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.920
A White House statement says a ceasefire will open a humanitarian corridor into the besieged Ukrainian

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:12.120
town of Oleshky next week. This is Omni View, episode 214, an Israeli military order in

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:18.200
the West Bank, a merchant ship sunk in the Black Sea, a building collapse in Nairobi, then understanding

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:23.260
the issue. First lady Melania Trump helped secure the agreement for a pause in the Russian

00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:29.000
occupied town in southern Kerson. The Guardian reported the claim that the town faces starvation

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.860
and lacks running water after months without deliveries.

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:37.940
The pause is scheduled to begin on October 29th to allow food, medicine, and an evacuation

00:00:37.940 --> 00:00:39.220
of elderly residents.

00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:42.520
Ukraine and Russia have not yet confirmed the arrangement.

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:47.940
The BBC added that remaining residents have eaten garden weeds to survive under occupation

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:49.140
since 2022.

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:51.400
The factual ground is simple.

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:56.580
One capital has announced a planned pause, and the two governments fighting over the ground

00:00:56.580 --> 00:01:01.880
have not matched that announcement. Where the accounts then divide is how far to treat the plan

00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:07.280
is done. The White House presents the First Lady's role as having helped lock in a rare opening

00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:13.180
for food, medicine, and the elderly in a town it says is on the brink. That is the case for treating

00:01:13.180 --> 00:01:19.180
the statement as a secured humanitarian pause, rather than a wish. The missing confirmations from

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:24.920
Kiev and Moscow are the limit inside that same account. The announcement still describes a schedule,

00:01:24.920 --> 00:01:26.920
not verified orders on the ground.

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:32.340
The Guardian and the BBC both noted that the statement came after earlier appeals by Pope

00:01:32.340 --> 00:01:35.880
Leo and after reported discussions between Putin and Trump.

00:01:36.580 --> 00:01:41.940
Those outlets frame the moment as a rare humanitarian opening amid ongoing accusations between

00:01:41.940 --> 00:01:44.220
the two sides over block supplies.

00:01:44.860 --> 00:01:47.260
What happens next sits with those two capitals.

00:01:47.780 --> 00:01:52.360
Without matching word from Ukraine and from Russia, the pause remains an opening bid.

00:01:52.360 --> 00:01:57.693
An exchange of fire near Hebron killed two Israeli soldiers and two Palestinians,

00:01:58.253 --> 00:02:02.873
and Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu then directed the army to prepare an extensive

00:02:02.873 --> 00:02:05.113
operation in the occupied West Bank.

00:02:05.713 --> 00:02:09.253
The military described the incident as the thwarting of a terror attack.

00:02:09.873 --> 00:02:14.693
The order includes house-to-house searches and home demolitions on a scale not seen in decades.

00:02:15.393 --> 00:02:20.213
Everything turns on whether the operation is read as a direct security reply to that checkpoint

00:02:20.213 --> 00:02:30.193
or as a campaign time to politics. Netanyahu's instruction and the military's account of a terror attack stopped is the case for a large ground response.

00:02:30.913 --> 00:02:40.333
Two soldiers are dead, the Army says it disrupted an attack, and the Prime Minister has told it to prepare searches and demolitions at a scale unseen in the territory for decades.

00:02:40.893 --> 00:02:45.313
Coverage in the same report notes that the order came days before legislative elections

00:02:45.313 --> 00:02:50.433
and amid high tensions, and it records the Prime Minister's call for operations on a scale

00:02:50.433 --> 00:02:51.573
unseen for decades.

00:02:52.253 --> 00:02:56.913
That timing is the case for hearing the order as more than a battlefield sequel, without

00:02:56.913 --> 00:02:58.433
denying the deaths at the checkpoint.

00:02:59.013 --> 00:03:03.573
The report does not record a concession from the Prime Minister's own camp on that calendar.

00:03:04.093 --> 00:03:08.533
What happens next is the Army's preparation of the searches and demolitions he directed.

00:03:08.533 --> 00:03:13.929
reported. Romanian President Nikus Ordan blamed Russia for a drone attack that sank the

00:03:13.929 --> 00:03:17.369
merchant vessel Koriv near Romanian territorial waters.

00:03:18.149 --> 00:03:20.309
Deutscheweller reported the attack and the toll.

00:03:20.929 --> 00:03:26.589
One sailor died, three remained missing from a crew of 13 Ukrainians and Azaris, and nine

00:03:26.589 --> 00:03:27.189
were rescued.

00:03:27.869 --> 00:03:31.489
The strike is reported as the fourth on merchant ships in the area this month.

00:03:32.089 --> 00:03:37.289
Similar incidents earlier in October prompted concerns from both Romania and Bulgaria about

00:03:37.289 --> 00:03:41.229
proximity to waters of the North Atlantic Treaty Organization, or NATO.

00:03:41.989 --> 00:03:46.949
The outlet quoted European Commission President Ursula von der Leyen, the head of the European

00:03:46.949 --> 00:03:50.469
Union's executive body, calling the attacks unacceptable.

00:03:51.169 --> 00:03:55.369
Coverage links the incidents to Russia's campaign against Ukrainian grain exports.

00:03:56.129 --> 00:03:59.229
Nine people were pulled from the water, three have not been found.

00:04:00.294 --> 00:04:05.074
Nairobi's easily-district saw an unfinished multi-story building under construction collapse,

00:04:05.074 --> 00:04:09.194
caps, and local authorities confirmed the incident and said people may be trapped.

00:04:09.874 --> 00:04:12.574
Deutschewella had already been named on the Black Sea attack.

00:04:13.194 --> 00:04:17.914
The Hindu described videos showing dust clouds over a busy commercial and residential area.

00:04:18.514 --> 00:04:23.414
Accounts of the building's height conflict, ranging from more than 10 floors to 18 stories,

00:04:23.894 --> 00:04:25.714
and only the ground floor was occupied.

00:04:26.414 --> 00:04:31.034
Rescue efforts were complicated when police used tear gas to disperse looters at the site.

00:04:31.034 --> 00:04:36.054
state. Both outlets placed the event within Nairobi's rapid construction boom and a history

00:04:36.054 --> 00:04:40.974
of collapses. Search teams were working the rubble while police tried to keep looters off

00:04:40.974 --> 00:04:46.869
the site. US stocks fell as the Dow Jones industrial average, a gauge of major American

00:04:46.869 --> 00:04:52.969
companies, dropped more than 800 points on Friday. CNBC reported that the decline occurred

00:04:52.969 --> 00:04:58.329
on a single trading day, and that selling spread beyond technology stocks as investors reacted

00:04:58.329 --> 00:05:00.169
to heightened tensions in the Middle East.

00:05:00.709 --> 00:05:05.269
Coverage presents the drop as a direct market response to those geopolitical developments,

00:05:05.769 --> 00:05:07.669
without attributing specific forecasts.

00:05:08.861 --> 00:05:14.641
Volvo cars shares fell 22% after the company reported a sharper than expected slump in China

00:05:14.641 --> 00:05:15.041
sales.

00:05:15.601 --> 00:05:20.261
Chief executive Jim Rowan cited tougher market conditions in both China and the United

00:05:20.261 --> 00:05:22.241
States that reduced free cash flow.

00:05:22.741 --> 00:05:26.381
The third quarter results came with a separate but parallel corporate move.

00:05:26.381 --> 00:05:31.321
American Express announced a $336 million restructuring charge.

00:05:31.741 --> 00:05:35.901
Coverage ties the Volvo decline to weakening demand in key export markets.

00:05:36.970 --> 00:05:41.250
President Emmanuel Macron is scheduled to meet student union representatives for the

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:46.610
first time since protests over school conditions began, and that meeting is progress worth knowing

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:47.850
in the government's response.

00:05:48.530 --> 00:05:52.930
France 24 reported the planned encounter as a new step after earlier violence.

00:05:52.930 --> 00:05:57.850
The meeting comes as the government prepares for further demonstrations, and has already

